### WebSyner API — shared variables
#
# Open these .http files with the VS Code "REST Client" extension
# (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request" above any block.
#
# Workflow: run auth.http → Login first; copy the accessToken from the
# response into @token below (or use the {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
# chaining shown in auth.http).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token-here
